  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection of the loggerhead turtles in Sal Island, Cabo Verde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will conduct patrols to protect loggerhead nesting females and nests at primary nesting beaches on the Island of Sal throughout the nesting season, and conduct conservation related education and outreach activities with local schools, youth and other groups. The USFWS will work closely with grantee in setting goals, priorities, and developing budgets, and will provide assistance as needed and requested in engaging with National Governmental and other institutions to improve collaboration and conservation outcomes. USFWS will also provide assistance as necessary to ensure effective collaboration and cooperation between all MTCA grant recipients working within Cape Verde.</narrative>
  </description>
